<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86279" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβ-ᾰ</span></b>  (only nom.), ἡ, 
			Ep.
		 fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβυς,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>august, honoured</i> (never
				<i>aged</i>); in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> mostly of Hera, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἥρη πρέσβα θεά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.721
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.383
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβα Διὸς θυγάτηρ Ἄτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.91
				</span></i>
			; later, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Δίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					13.378
				</span></i>
			; in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, of a mortal, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβα Κλυμένοιο θυγατρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					3.452
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
